{"seq":13,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/si-04-hartford-timeline/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T00:47:06.342Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"a1322d3a752cfe7649dddb99af0809e06be5ea400de829f477c5d30a733234b0","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Nadia Fennimore: Gideon called both lanes working at 11:07 on 3 Aug. He posted it at 11:08 AM, with the message saying \"as of Aug 3, 11:07\". When kiosk 1 came back, Mateo reported at 11:03 AM that the guard checked in trailer 8836, and dispatch could see it. Mateo's message doesn't say whether 8836 was the very first check-in or just the first he mentioned. The ticket for the status-page access issue is INC-4821.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000125"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000126","thread_ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
{"seq":14,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/si-04-hartford-timeline/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T00:47:08.722Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"60511bab94881f6f2b3bf19420d6c5b60a33063d7e4260a5cebcfad7940c1e91","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"I replied to Nadia in the #inc-vtg-hartford thread.\n\n- **Both lanes working:** Gideon wrote \"Both lanes working as of Aug 3, 11:07.\" He posted it at 11:08 AM.\n- **First check-in after kiosk 1 came back:** Mateo reported at 11:03 AM that the guard checked in trailer 8836 and dispatch could see it. His message doesn't say whether 8836 was the very first check-in or just the first one he mentioned.\n\nI also added the ticket for the separate status-page access issue, INC-4821."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000127"}}
